    "title": "Every robot is a lesson in engineering, coding and teamwork.",
    "html": "<section id=\"why\" style=\"background:#0E1A2B;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Rubik', Arial, sans-serif;padding:128px;display:flex;flex-direction:row;align-items:center;gap:96px\">\n<img src=\"/images/wro/wro-2025-team-hcb-homecare-bot.webp\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:1920px;height:1080px;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 60%;filter:blur(28px) saturate(1.3);transform:scale(1.1)\">\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:1920px;height:1080px;background:rgba(14,26,43,0.45)\"></div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:1920px;height:1080px;background:linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(47,128,237,0.72) 0%, rgba(214,51,132,0.66) 50%, rgba(245,166,35,0.66) 100%)\"></div>\n<div style=\"position:relative;flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:36px\">\n<p style=\"font-size:28px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:5px;text-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(8,17,29,0.5)\">Part 1 · Robotics &amp; AI engineering</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:88px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.05;text-transform:uppercase;text-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(8,17,29,0.5)\">Every robot is a lesson in engineering, coding and teamwork.</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:34px;line-height:1.4;text-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(8,17,29,0.5)\">You don’t need a lab or a big budget to start. You need curiosity, a small kit — and permission to fail.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:700;color:#0E1A2B;background:#F5A623;padding:12px 32px;border-radius:999px;align-self:flex-start\">HomeCare Bot · Team HCB, WRO 2025</p>\n</div>\n<img src=\"/images/wro/wro-2025-team-hcb-homecare-bot.webp\" alt=\"HomeCare Bot · Team HCB, WRO 2025\" style=\"position:relative;width:680px;height:1080px;margin:-128px -128px -128px 0;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 60%;box-shadow:-24px 0 60px rgba(8,17,29,0.35)\">\n</section>"
